 <div class="offer-display-feature-text a-size-small" offer-display-feature-name="desktop-dynamic-support-info" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-csa-c-slot-id="odf-feature-text-desktop-dynamic-support-info" data-csa-c-content-id="desktop-dynamic-support-info" data-csa-c-id="a1dc7g-jb5we8-8vwv4e-xttjwm">
                                        <span class="a-declarative" data-action="a-popover" data-a-popover="{&quot;max-width&quot;:&quot;500&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;offerDisplayFeatureSupportPopover-0&quot;,&quot;activate&quot;:&quot;onmouseover&quot;,&quot;position&quot;:&quot;triggerBottom&quot;,&quot;popoverLabel&quot;:&quot;What&#39;s Product Support?&quot;}"> <a data-csa-c-content-id="odf-desktop-dynamic-support-info" data-csa-c-slot-id="odf-desktop-dynamic-support-info-anchor-text" data-csa-c-type="widget" class="a-link-normal a-popover-trigger a-declarative" href="javascript:void(0)" role="button" data-csa-c-id="9ptvsu-ah3zzu-q19t3x-y4i7e2"> <span class="a-size-small offer-display-feature-text-message">Product support included</span> </a> </span>   <div class="a-popover-preload" id="a-popover-offerDisplayFeatureSupportPopover-0"> <div data-csa-c-content-id="desktop-dynamic-support-info" data-csa-c-slot-id="odf-desktop-dynamic-support-info-popover-description" data-csa-c-type="widget" class="a-section a-padding-base" data-csa-c-id="arzjx0-nitpwx-cxqy40-etnzt7">  <div aria-level="5" class="a-row a-spacing-base" role="heading">  <span class="a-text-bold">What's Product Support?</span> </div>  <div class="a-row a-spacing-micro">    In the event your product doesn't work as expected or you need help using it, Amazon offers free product support options such as live phone/chat with an Amazon associate, manufacturer contact information, step-by-step troubleshooting guides, and help videos. 

By solving product issues, we help the planet by extending the life of products. Availability of support options differ by product and country.     <a data-csa-c-content-id="desktop-dynamic-support-info" data-csa-c-slot-id="odf-desktop-dynamic-support-info-hyperlink" data-csa-c-type="widget" class="a-link-normal a-nowrap" target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://www.amazon.com/ps/product-support?ref_=dp_pls_support&amp;ref_=dp_ret_policy" data-csa-c-id="u5b0i6-fs18qa-5tbj69-7exv9r"> <span class="a-size-small">Learn more</span> </a>  </div>  </div> </div>             </div>                                   </div>
                                         <div id="dynamicGiftWrapInfoFeature_feature_div" class="celwidget pd_rd_w-lrsQw pd_rd_r-7SN8NGR6VF5ENCSCDTR3 pd_rd_wg-bIdHr aok-hidden" data-feature-name="dynamicGiftWrapInfoFeature" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-csa-c-content-id="dynamicGiftWrapInfoFeature" data-csa-c-slot-id="dynamicGiftWrapInfoFeature_feature_div" data-csa-c-asin="B092CB69Q4" data-csa-c-is-in-initial-active-row="false" data-csa-c-id="9quhjl-ppph1c-mj87cv-l9esux" data-cel-widget="dynamicGiftWrapInfoFeature_feature_div">
                                                           <div class="offer-display-feature-label celwidget pd_rd_w-lrsQw pd_rd_r-7SN8NGR6VF5ENCSCDTR3 pd_rd_wg-bIdHr a-size-small" offer-display-feature-name="desktop-dynamic-gift-wrap" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-csa-c-slot-id="odf-feature-label-desktop-dynamic-gift-wrap" data-csa-c-content-id="desktop-dynamic-gift-wrap" data-cel-widget="desktop-dynamic-gift-wrap" role="heading" aria-level="4" data-csa-c-id="y4qw1y-a3ozij-f0ldza-k6j9ho">
