            <span class="a-size-small a-color-tertiary">Gift options</span> </div>
    </div>
 <div class="offer-display-feature-text a-size-small" offer-display-feature-name="desktop-dynamic-gift-wrap" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-csa-c-slot-id="odf-feature-text-desktop-dynamic-gift-wrap" data-csa-c-content-id="desktop-dynamic-gift-wrap" data-csa-c-id="jzvrsn-2p44mu-3ulkpv-dwaiym">
               <!-- Gets the template from Gifting team's package. Other files will be added here for other use cases with same content type  -->
                     <span class="a-declarative" data-action="a-modal" data-a-modal="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;offerDisplayFeatureGiftWrapPopover-0&quot;,&quot;header&quot;:&quot;Gift options&quot;,&quot;position&quot;:&quot;triggerBottom&quot;,&quot;popoverLabel&quot;:&quot;Gift options&quot;}"> <a data-csa-c-content-id="odf-desktop-dynamic-gift-wrap" data-csa-c-slot-id="odf-desktop-dynamic-gift-wrap-anchor-text" data-csa-c-type="widget" class="a-link-normal a-popover-trigger a-declarative" href="javascript:void(0)" role="button" data-csa-c-id="lyhazs-h9csli-wzwt9q-mol1pl"> <div class="offer-display-feature-text">
                    <span data-bo-index="0" class="a-size-small offer-display-feature-text-message gift-wrap-message"> Available at checkout </span> </div>
                 <div class="aok-hidden">
                    <span data-bo-index="0" class="gift-wrap-unchecked-message"> Available at checkout </span> <span data-bo-index="0" class="gift-wrap-checked-message"> This item is a gift. Change </span> </div>
            </a> </span>   <div class="a-popover-preload" id="a-popover-offerDisplayFeatureGiftWrapPopover-0"> <div data-csa-c-content-id="desktop-dynamic-gift-wrap" data-csa-c-slot-id="odf-desktop-dynamic-gift-wrap-popover-description" data-csa-c-type="widget" class="a-section a-padding-base" data-csa-c-id="w7mbqi-tcxhzv-o0q671-530jm4"> <div class="a-row a-spacing-base"> At checkout, you can add a custom message, a gift receipt for easy returns and have the item gift-wrapped </div>  <div class="a-row a-spacing-micro"> <div data-bo-index="0" class="a-checkbox odf-gift-wrap"><label><input type="checkbox" name="" value="" autocomplete="off"><i class="a-icon a-icon-checkbox"></i><span class="a-label a-checkbox-label">Add gift options at checkout</span></label></div> </div>  </div> </div>  <div data-a-input-name="gift-wrap" data-bo-index="0" class="a-checkbox aok-hidden"><label for="gift-wrap"><input id="gift-wrap" type="checkbox" name="gift-wrap" value="yes" autocomplete="off"><i class="a-icon a-icon-checkbox"></i><span class="a-label a-checkbox-label"></span></label></div>         </div>                                    </div>
