tches, HERO 25K sensor with sub-micron precision, PTFE feet, a dual-mode scroll wheel, and a reversible/removable DPI-shift button.

• Wireless models feature LIGHTSPEED wireless technology (68% faster than the previous generation), LIGHTSYNC RGB lighting that reacts to gameplay, up to 120 hours of battery life (lighting off), USB-C connectivity, and compatibility with Logitech&amp;#39;s POWERPLAY wireless charging mousepad.

