y chain sustainability, raw materials innovation, renewable energy use, insetting, sustainable transportation and packaging.</p><p><span class="a-declarative" data-action="CPF-OpenExternalLink" data-cpf-openexternallink="{}"><a href="https://www.climeco.com/stand-out-on-amazon-as-a-climeco-certified-product/">Learn more about this certification</a></span></p>         </span>     </div>      </div>                         </div>                                      </div>             </div>         </div>     </div> </div>      </div>                                                      <footer class="cpf-dpx-sticky-footer">     <a class="a-link-normal aok-inline-block cpf-features-footer-link" href="https://www.amazon.com/climatepledgefriendly">         <span class="a-declarative" data-action="CPF-BTF-LandingPageLink" data-cpf-btf-landingpagelink="{}">             <h3 class="a-spacing-none">                 <div alt="Climate Pledge Friendly" style="height:24px;width:186px;" class="a-image-wrapper a-manually-loaded" data-a-image-source="https://f.media-amazon.com/images/I/21AGu0JFvKL.svg"></div>             </h3>             <div class="a-section a-spacing-none">                 <span class="a-size-base a-color-base aok-inline-block a-text-normal">Discover more products with sustainability features.</span> <span class="a-size-base cpf-dpx-link-text">Learn more</span>             </div>         </span>     </a> </footer>     </div> </div> <style>     .cpf-badge-text-desktop {         text-decoration: none !important;         color: var(--aok-sfs-color-badge-tertiary-fg, #0F1111) !important;     }     .cpf-badge-text-desktop:hover {         color: #c7511f !important;     }     .cpf-badge-focus-ring:focus {         outline: none !important;     }     .cpf-badge-focus-ring:focus-visible {         outline: 2px solid #767676 !important;     } </style>         </div>                                                     </div>                 </li>                            