s - while some find it ergonomic for long sessions and worth the money, others report issues with battery drain and premium materials not matching the price. The durability is also mixed, with some praising its longevity while others report it breaking after mild use within four months.<!-- k-injected k-component-close --></span><!-- k-injected k-component-close --><!-- k-injected k-component-close --><!-- k-injected k-component-close --><!-- k-injected k-component-close --></div><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-component=SharedContent-a1xC_XJJvXZe2O_ k-id=81e3f292-f5ee-4714-ae62-78f4c6394e3f k-data=[omitted] k-closure-key=aspectReadMoreE_320_13 k-closure-holder=3bf62ad0-77cd-47c3-8daf-801fdd767ca9 k-init k-ready--><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-component=ExperimentalShow-m341qX1jtPsrE6B k-id=c8063bff-6da5-4905-b748-e8525ec4f14c k-composed=ExperimentalSho_165_5 k-parent=81e3f292-f5ee-4714-ae62-78f4c6394e3f k-data=[omitted] k-init k-ready--><div class="aui-primitive __HcW37uIi- __HcWIi-82IiB1 __HcWIi-bS7X-z" style="" k-observe="" k-use="c8063bff-6da5-4905-b748-e8525ec4f14c" k-class="condition_style_50_3" k-style="inlineStyles_51_3" k-init="" k-bound=""><div data-testid="ai-disclaimer" style="" class="aui-primitive __HcW37uIi- __HcWIi-82IY0d __P0nNOOvptwIJ __HcWz_SzO0"><span style="white-space: pre-line;" class="aui-primitive __HcWWkUdHN __HcWNg-FAv __3LVrZoFAv">AI Generated from the text of customer reviews</span><img src="./logitech-g502_files/sfwfCa9XX12F4At.png" k-metric-loaded-enabled="false" aria-hidden="true" style="display:inline-block;height:18px;width:18px;object-fit:cover;" class="aui-primitive __P0nNOOKHIa4a __P0nNOONh5Qzh __HcWIi-bS7X-z"><span style="white-space: pre-line;" aria-hidden="true" class="aui-primitive __dChNmAwPaMXsw4B __HcWIi-bS7a4a __SAR2l0zNyyuZ"> Generated from the text of customer reviews</span></div><h4 style="white-space: pre-line;" data-testid="aspect-cta" class="aui-primitive __P0nNOOvptgdu __SARCET4AB __SAR2l0zNyyuZ">Sele