tyle="inlineStyles_160_3" k-class="mergedStyles_161_3" onclick="" k-init="" k-bound=""><img src="./logitech-g502_files/FQQMS6xydSSApTa.png" k-metric-loaded-enabled="false" aria-hidden="true" style="display:inline-block;height:12px;width:12px;object-fit:cover;" class="aui-primitive __HcWIi-bS7X-z"></button><!-- k-injected k-component-close --><!-- k-injected k-component-close --></div><span style="white-space: pre-line;" data-testid="aspect-summary" class="aui-primitive __P0nNOOvpt01x __SAR2l0zNyyuZ">Customers have mixed experiences with the mouse's durability, with some reporting amazing longevity and feeling durable, while others mention it breaking with mild use after 4 months or lasting only a week and a half.</span><div style="" class="aui-primitive __HcW37uIi- __HcWIi-82IiB1 __HcWIi-bS7X-z __P0nNOOKHIwIJ"><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-component=SnippetList-p7YoaSkonpmESLV k-id=1bfcc851-1d23-4943-ada0-4911d8e9910c k-composed=SnippetList_asp_100_25 k-parent=d7b5870a-d2bf-44be-9198-cd386e309a11 k-data=[omitted] k-init k-ready--><div style="" class="aui-primitive __HcW37uIi- __HcWIi-82IiB1 __HcWIi-bS7X-z"><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-expand=snippet_36_21 k-id=7f1c00f7-98e4-4c59-bdc6-4c78914812cf k-parent=1bfcc851-1d23-4943-ada0-4911d8e9910c k-data=[omitted] k-init--><div style="" class="aui-primitive __HcW37uIi- __HcWIi-82IiB1 __HcWIi-bS7X-z __P0nNOOvpt01x"><div data-csa-c-type="uxElement" data-csa-c-item-id="cr-product-insights-detail-page_read-more-link" data-csa-c-pos="" data-csa-c-posx="" data-csa-c-posy="" data-csa-c-owner="CustomerReviews" data-csa-c-item-type="" data-csa-c-parent-element-id="" class="aui-primitive" data-csa-c-slot-id="cr-product-insights-detail-page_read-more-link" data-csa-c-id="rm6dfx-174437-r7i6mr-gi3of3"><span style="white-space: pre-line;" class="aui-primitive __SAR2l0zNyyuZ"><span style="white-space: pre-line;" aria-hidden="true" class="aui-primitive __SAR2l0zNyyuZ">"</span><span style="white-space: pre-line;" class="a