o"><i class="a-icon a-icon-close-white a-icon-medium" role="presentation"></i></button></div><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-media-list-view-container_1kFg1" data-hook="ReviewMediaList"><button data-popover-id="R20J4HHS7NTR3T" class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-media-list-overlay_2x3M5" data-mix-operations="ReviewMediaPopoverNextMediaClickHandler"></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></span></li><li><span class="a-list-item"><div data-hook="reviewContainer" data-translatable="false" data-reviewid="R2EG42MLA8NHRW" data-asin="B092CB69Q4" data-mobile="false" data-locale="en-US" data-localelanguagename="English" data-sourcelanguage="en-US" data-sourcelanguagename="English" data-iscustomerrecognized="true" data-iskindleapp="false" data-isandroidapp="false" data-isiosapp="false" data-ismshop="false" data-marketplaceid="ATVPDKIKX0DER"><div id="R2EG42MLA8NHRW" data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-R2EG42MLA8NHRW" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-hook="review" class="a-section aok-relative" data-csa-c-id="bin288-30nsfx-qpokkf-k9ahx0"><div data-hook="genome-widget" class="a-row a-spacing-mini"><a href="https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AGYT6WOV3CR37I6LZLITPWBXBHOQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top" data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-R2EG42MLA8NHRW_profile" data-csa-c-type="element" class="a-profile _Y3Itd_profile-link_2n23E" data-a-size="small" data-csa-c-id="7auouw-5y6b68-e532ow-i7p8nt"><div aria-hidden="true" class="a-profile-avatar-wrapper"><div class="a-profile-avatar"><img src="./logitech-g502_files/grey-pixel.gif" class="a-lazy-loaded" data-src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default._SX48_.png"><noscript><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default._SX48_.png"/></noscript></div></div><div class="a-profile-content"><span class="a-profile-name">Jalen</span></div></a></div><div class="_Y3Itd_single-review-star-rating-bar-desktop_1T97A"><i data-hook="review-star-rating" class="a-icon a-icon-star a-star-5"><span class="a-icon-alt">5 out of 5 stars</span></i><span class="a-letter-space"></span></div><a class="a-size-base a-color-base a-link-normal a-text-bold" href="https://www.amazon.com/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2EG42MLA8NHRW/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&amp;ie=UTF8"><h5 class="_Y3Itd_single-review-title_2aKRE" data-hook="reviewTitle" lang="en-US">I've been with logitech since 5th grade (2005)</h5></a><div data-hook="review-by-line" class="a-row a-spacing-none"><span data-hook="review-date" class="a-size-base a-color-tertiary">Reviewed in the United States on August 31, 2026</span></div><div data-hook="product-variation-attributes" class="a-row a-spacing-mini"><a data-hook="format-strip" class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.com/portal/customer-reviews/B092CB69Q4/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_fmt?_encoding=UTF8&amp;formatType=current_format"><span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary">Color: Black<i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i></span><span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary">Style: Wireless<i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i></span><span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary">Pattern Name: RGB<i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i></span><span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary">Configuration: Mouse</span></a><i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i><span class="_Y3Itd_inline-contributor_33jDb"><div data-hook="review-badges"><a class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.com/gp/help/customer/display.html/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_avp?ie=UTF8&amp;nodeId=G8UYX7LALQC8V9KA"><span data-hook="avp-badge" class="a-size-mini a-color-state a-text-bold">Verified Purchase</span></a></div></span></div><div data-hook="reviewTextContainer" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-text-container_325WM"><div data-hook="reviewText" class="a-cardui-deck _Y3Itd_card-deck_37S9P" data-a-remove-top-gutter="true" data-a-remove-bottom-gutter="true" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-5"><div class="a-teaser-describedby-collapsed a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-5-teaser-describedby-collapsed">Brief content visible, double tap to read full content.</div><div class="a-teaser-describedby-expanded a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-5-teaser-describedby-expanded">Full content visible, double tap to read brief content.</div><div data-csa-c-slot-id="true" data-csa-c-type="element" class="a-cardui _Y3Itd_peek-expand_3G9Ub" data-a-card-type="peekExpand" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-5-card0" data-csa-c-id="hz2csb-5x4xn5-di3q3q-cvx2xf"><div class="a-cardui-body _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-reactive-container a-reactive-container-transition"><div><div class="a-cardui-content a-cardui-uninitialized" data-a-max-height="300" style="max-height:300px"><div class="_Y3Itd_relative_1SChh"><div data-hook="reviewRichContentContainer" lang="en-US" class="_Y3Itd_contain-rich-content_2IORW"><p><span>Ive been with logitech since 5th grade in 2005 when my mom bought me a logitech extreme 3d joystick for microsoft flight simulator on our crappy home computer. Since then I have probably bought a few mice and controllers from logitech. Mainly I enjoy logitech's mice the most, theyre just good, they never break (from QC issues)or have software issues. The only time these mice break are after years of heavy use and it usually results in misclicking or double clicking and that will happen to any brand of mice as nothing mechanical lasts forever under use..</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>At one point I think logitech upgraded me like 2-3 times over the years for free. I bought a G700 in 2012 and got a double click a lot sooner than it should've been. They gave me a G700S (upgrade) then, I think that didn't last more than a year or 2 as well and then they sent me the G502 proteus core (the OG G502) in 2014. That G502 lasted me till 2021!!!! even though the plastic was warped from my sweaty hands and the blue LED lights were no longer all blue but some were kinda greenish blue due to the LED reaching end of life (very very impressive). I actually only threw that mouse away last year and it still worked perfectly, it was just beyond dirty, warped plastic from thousands of hours of use and had a frayed cable (wired).</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>Then I got a G502 lightspeed in 2021 and it started to misclick.. like it started to let go of a click that I was still holding a few months ago. I ended up just buying this one because they have the best mice, the least intrusive software and good customer service.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>Logitech used to replace a lot of products WELL after warranty. I don't think they are that way anymore which is fine. Logitech deserves the money and I never feel that way about a big company but they really care and you get a quality product that's gonna last you at least 4-5 years nowadays. Personally I have been at 800dpi since 2012 when I got that G700 and haven't gone back. Sometimes I turn it up or down 100dpi but I dont see the need to advertise crazy mouse sensitivity when most just end up turning down the sens in game anyhow.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>This mouse has a better battery life than the G502 lightspeed. I always keep it on a lower RGB brightness setting 20-35% is enough to look cool but not be distracting and also not drain your battery. I kinda don't care now though because logitechs newer mice take usb-c where my older ones took micro usb which was annoying to find all the time when I needed to charge.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>This is the best fitting mouse you will probably ever use if you're a palm enjoyer like me. The software and mouse are beyond easy to use. You can adjust the dpi up and down with the buttons and the colors change when you do that so you know which mode you're in. Also it fits in your hand and is very portable if you wanted to use it on the go.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>Basically if you're a mouse palm user then you will likely be a lifetime logitech customer because they're just the best mouse you will ever use.</span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="a-reactive-container-gradient"></div></div></div><div data-hook="reviewExpandButtonContainer" class="a-cardui-footer _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer _Y3Itd_read-more-less_2uDYd" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-csa-interaction-events="click" data-csa-c-id="uy4imm-g8o17y-d9mvio-d25kp"><a href="javascript:void(0)" class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer-button" role="button"><span class="a-expander-icon"><i class="a-css-icon a-css-icon-draw a-css-icon-expand"></i></span><span class="a-see-more a-color-link"><span class="a-see-more-text" style="">Read more</span><span class="a-see-less-text" style="display:none">Read less</span></span></a></div></div></div></div><div data-hook="translationSpinner" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner-container_ypxf2" style="display: none !important;"><div class="a-spinner-wrapper _Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner_1tBUJ"><span class="a-spinner a-spinner-medium"></span></div></div></div><div class="a-section a-spacing-small"><div class="a-section a-spacing-none _Y3Itd_single-review-image-tile-section_15c2C"><button class="_Y3Itd_single-review-thumbnail-container_9KgXc" data-mix-operations="SingleReviewMediaImageThumbnailClickHandler" data-reviewid="R2EG42MLA8NHRW" data-physicalid="610KZ+Xob7L"><img alt="I&#39;ve been with logitech since 5th grade (2005)" src="./logitech-g502_files/610KZ+Xob7L._SY500_.jpg" data-hook="review-image-tile" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-image-tile_3c5HW"></button><div id="mediaModal_R2EG42MLA8NHRW"><div class="a-popover-preload" id="a-popover-cr-top-reviews-media-modal_R2EG42MLA8NHRW"><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-header-container_1kb6I"></div><div class="_Y3Itd_single-review-media-popover-container_FDNFG" data-hook="media-popover-container"><div class="_Y3Itd_modal-content-container_1p_Aj" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-reviewbind="SingleReviewMediaBlock" data-reviewid="R2EG42MLA8NHRW" data-csa-c-slot-id="cm_cr_image_popover" data-closebuttonaria="" data-modaltitlearia="" data-hook="modal-content-container" data-csa-c-id="i46y9-cdwpzl-7amhgu-qrpbym"><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-body-container_3kalb"><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-media-container_39x8v"><button class="_Y3Itd_left-icon-container_1saao" data-mix-operations="leftClickHandler"><span class="_Y3Itd_cr-icon_S_3MZ"><img role="img" aria-label="" class="_Y3Itd_button-icon_1Xsqv" src="./logitech-g502_files/23pID5Mp1WTA-31.svg"></span></button><div data-reviewbind="MainMedia" class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-modal-media-list-view-container_1uARM"><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-image-view-container_1XEVZ" data-mediaid="610KZ+Xob7L" data-lazyimagesource="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/W/BW_MEDIAX_AVIF_MEASUREMENT_1306696-T2/images/I/610KZ+Xob7L.jpg" data-csa-c-type="element" data-csa-c-slot-id="cm_cr_image_popover_610KZ+Xob7L_0" data-csa-c-id="w73wyg-ldvkz6-11o440-h9ootq"><img alt="I&#39;ve been with logitech since 5th grade (2005)" src="./logitech-g502_files/610KZ+Xob7L._SY500_.jpg" class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-image-view_1J8fN"></div></div><button class="_Y3Itd_right-icon-container_2ryP4" data-mix-operations="rightClickHandler"><span class="_Y3Itd_cr-icon_S_3MZ"><img role="img" aria-label="" class="_Y3Itd_button-icon_1Xsqv" src="./logitech-g502_files/7D8iRtQ0DrKAF4O.svg"></span></button></div><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-review-container_1w2Ex"><div class="a-section _Y3Itd_cr-media-popover-sidepanel-container_2rHXZ"><div class="a-section a-spacing-small _Y3Itd_cr-media-popover-sidepanel-header-section_KhwYb"><div data-hook="genome-widget" class="a-row a-spacing-mini"><a href="https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AGYT6WOV3CR37I6LZLITPWBXBHOQ" data-csa-c-slot-id="profile" data-csa-c-type="element" class="a-profile _Y3Itd_profile-link_2n23E" data-a-size="small" data-csa-c-id="n4veu2-nmo3gs-gi3vmk-v20k1j"><div aria-hidden="true" class="a-profile-avatar-wrapper"><div class="a-profile-avatar"><img src="./logitech-g502_files/grey-pixel.gif" class="a-lazy-loaded" data-src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default._SX48_.png" style=""><noscript><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default._SX48_.png"/></noscript></div></div><div class="a-profile-content"><span class="a-profile-name">Jalen</span></div></a></div><div class="a-section a-spacing-none"><div class="_Y3Itd_single-review-star-rating-bar-desktop_1T97A"><i data-hook="review-star-rating" class="a-icon a-icon-star a-star-5"><span class="a-icon-alt">5 out of 5 stars</span></i><span class="a-letter-space"></span></div><a class="a-size-base a-color-base a-link-normal a-text-bold" href="https://www.amazon.com/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2EG42MLA8NHRW/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&amp;ie=UTF8"><h5 class="_Y3Itd_single-review-title_2aKRE" data-hook="reviewTitle" lang="en-US">I've been with logitech since 5th grade (2005)</h5></a><div data-hook="review-by-line" class="a-row a-spacing-none"><span data-hook="review-date" class="a-size-base a-color-tertiary">Reviewed in the United States on August 31, 2026</span></div><div data-hook="product-variation-attributes" class="a-row a-spacing-mini"><a data-hook="format-strip" class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.com/portal/customer-reviews/B092CB69Q4/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_fmt?_encoding=UTF8&amp;formatType=current_format"><span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary">Color: Black<i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i></span><span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary">Style: Wireless<i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i></span><span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary">Pattern Name: RGB<i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i></span><span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary">Configuration: Mouse</span></a><i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i><span class="_Y3Itd_inline-contributor_33jDb"><div data-hook="review-badges"><a class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.com/gp/help/customer/display.html/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_avp?ie=UTF8&amp;nodeId=G8UYX7LALQC8V9KA"><span data-hook="avp-badge" class="a-size-mini a-color-state a-text-bold">Verified Purchase</span></a></div></span></div></div><p><span>Ive been with logitech since 5th grade in 2005 when my mom bought me a logitech extreme 3d joystick for microsoft flight simulator on our crappy home computer. Since then I have probably bought a few mice and controllers from logitech. Mainly I enjoy logitech's mice the most, theyre just good, they never break (from QC issues)or have software issues. The only time these mice break are after years of heavy use and it usually results in misclicking or double clicking and that will happen to any brand of mice as nothing mechanical lasts forever under use..</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>At one point I think logitech upgraded me like 2-3 times over the years for free. I bought a G700 in 2012 and got a double click a lot sooner than it should've been. They gave me a G700S (upgrade) then, I think that didn't last more than a year or 2 as well and then they sent me the G502 proteus core (the OG G502) in 2014. That G502 lasted me till 2021!!!! even though the plastic was warped from my sweaty hands and the blue LED lights were no longer all blue but some were kinda greenish blue due to the LED reaching end of life (very very impressive). I actually only threw that mouse away last year and it still worked perfectly, it was just beyond dirty, warped plastic from thousands of hours of use and had a frayed cable (wired).</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>Then I got a G502 lightspeed in 2021 and it started to misclick.. like it started to let go of a click that I was still holding a few months ago. I ended up just buying this one because they have the best mice, the least intrusive software and good customer service.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>Logitech used to replace a lot of products WELL after warranty. I don't think they are that way anymore which is fine. Logitech deserves the money and I never feel that way about a big company but they really care and you get a quality product that's gonna last you at least 4-5 years nowadays. Personally I have been at 800dpi since 2012 when I got that G700 and haven't gone back. Sometimes I turn it up or down 100dpi but I dont see the need to advertise crazy mouse sensitivity when most just end up turning down the sens in game anyhow.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>This mouse has a better battery life than the G502 lightspeed. I always keep it on a lower RGB brightness setting 20-35% is enough to look cool but not be distracting and also not drain your battery. I kinda don't care now though because logitechs newer mice take usb-c where my older ones took micro usb which was annoying to find all the time when I needed to charge.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>This is the best fitting mouse you will probably ever use if you're a palm enjoyer like me. The software and mouse are beyond easy to use. You can adjust the dpi up and down with the buttons and the colors change when you do that so you know which mode you're in. Also it fits in your hand and is very portable if you wanted to use it on the go.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>Basically if you're a mouse palm user then you will likely be a lifetime logitech customer because they're just the best mouse you will ever use.</span></p><ul class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-thumbnail-image-container_2nWBS" data-reviewbind="MediaThumbnailsBlock"><li class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-list-item-style_d1lj6" data-reviewbind="MediaThumbnail"><button data-mediaid="610KZ+Xob7L" data-reviewid="R2EG42MLA8NHRW" data-thumbidx="0" class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-thumbnail-image-button_2LRc_" data-mix-operations="thumbnailClickHandler" aria-pressed="false"><img alt="" src="./logitech-g502_files/610KZ+Xob7L.jpg" class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-thumbnail-image-view_2J_oP" height="80" width="80"></button></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="a-section a-spacing-small a-spacing-top-small"><div class="_Y3Itd_single-review-vote-action-bar_10AyR"><div data-hook="helpfulVoteWidget" class="a-section a-spacing-none _Y3Itd_cr-voting-section_1cNTp"><div class="_Y3Itd_cr-helpful-button_1u3UK cr-vote-component" data-hook="helpfulVoteButton" data-mix-operations="HelpfulVoteClickHandler" data-asin="B092CB69Q4" data-id="R2EG42MLA8NHRW" data-return-to="DpReview" data-csa-c-type="element" data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-R2EG42MLA8NHRW_helpful_button" data-csa-c-id="oqgjkt-3n1ezs-i9qwrj-f78xmz"><span class="a-button a-button-base" id="a-autoid-47"><span class="a-button-inner"><input type="submit" class="a-button-input" aria-labelledby="a-autoid-47-announce"><span class="a-button-text" aria-hidden="true" id="a-autoid-47-announce"><div class="_Y3Itd_cr-helpful-text-desktop_2dXQG">Helpful</div></span></span></span></div><span data-hook="helpfulVoteLoadingMessage" class="_Y3Itd_hidden_1J5OD">Sending feedback...</span><div data-hook="helpfulVoteSuccessMessage" class="a-box a-alert-inline a-alert-inline-success _Y3Itd_hidden_1J5OD a-spacing-block" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"><div class="a-box-inner a-alert-container"><i class="a-icon a-icon-alert" aria-hidden="true"></i><div class="a-alert-content">Thank you for your feedback.</div></div></div><div data-hook="helpfulVoteErrorMessage" class="a-box a-alert-inline a-alert-inline-error _Y3Itd_hidden_1J5OD a-spacing-block" role="alert"><div class="a-box-inner a-alert-container"><i class="a-icon a-icon-alert" aria-hidden="true"></i><div class="a-alert-content">Sorry, we failed to record your vote. Please try again</div></div></div></div><i aria-hidden="true" class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="img" aria-label="|"></i><div data-hook="reportAbuseButton" data-mix-operations="ReportAbuseOpenDialogClickHandler" data-dialog-kind="modal" data-asin="B092CB69Q4" data-id="R2EG42MLA8NHRW" data-return-to="DpReview" data-csa-c-type="element" data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-R2EG42MLA8NHRW_report_button" data-csa-c-id="wuk1m6-1ywg9b-5grpad-9c2jcu"><a aria-label="Report Review" class="a-size-base a-link-normal a-color-secondary a-text-normal" href="javascript:void(0)" role="button">Report</a></div><span data-hook="reportAbuseSendingMessage" class="_Y3Itd_hidden_ySuSy">Sending feedback...</span><div data-hook="reportAbuseSuccessMessage" class="a-box a-alert-inline a-alert-inline-success _Y3Itd_hidden_ySuSy a-spacing-block" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"><div class="a-box-inner a-alert-container"><i class="a-icon a-icon-alert" aria-hidden="true"></i><div class="a-alert-content">Thanks, we'll investigate in the next few days.</div></div></div><div data-hook="reportAbuseErrorMessage" class="a-box a-alert-inline a-alert-inline-error _Y3Itd_hidden_ySuSy a-spacing-block" role="alert"><div class="a-box-inner a-alert-container"><i class="a-icon a-icon-alert" aria-hidden="true"></i><div class="a-alert-content">Sorry, We failed to report this review. Please try again</div></div></div><div id="reportAbuseConfirmationDialog_R2EG42MLA8NHRW" data-closebuttonaria="Close Button" data-dialogheader="Report this review?" class="a-section aok-hidden"><div class="_Y3Itd_reportAbuseConfirmationContainer_1UPzg"><div class="a-section a-padding-large"><div class="a-row"><p>We'll check if this review meets our <a class="a-link-normal" target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://www.amazon.com/gp/help/customer/display.html?nodeId=GLHXEX85MENUE4XF&amp;ref=cm_cr_cg">community guidelines<span class="aok-offscreen">Opens in a new tab</span></a>. If it doesn't, we'll remove it.</p></div><div class="a-row a-spacing-top-base"><div class="_Y3Itd_reportAbuseConfirmationActions_27dEm"><div data-mix-operations="ReportAb