s="_Y3Itd_media-popover-media-list-overlay_2x3M5" data-mix-operations="ReviewMediaPopoverNextMediaClickHandler"><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-image-view-container_3FDDs" data-physicalid="610KZ+Xob7L" data-lazyimagesource="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/W/BW_MEDIAX_AVIF_MEASUREMENT_1306696-T2/images/I/610KZ+Xob7L.jpg"><img alt="I&#39;ve been with logitech since 5th grade (2005)" src="./logitech-g502_files/transparent-pixel._V192234675_.gif" class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-image-view_3Eum-"></div></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></span></li><li><span class="a-list-item"><div data-hook="reviewContainer" data-translatable="false" data-reviewid="R17ZRRSTSEBFKI" data-asin="B092CGJ1S5" data-mobile="false" data-locale="en-US" data-localelanguagename="English" data-sourcelanguage="en-US" data-sourcelanguagename="English" data-iscustomerrecognized="true" data-iskindleapp="false" data-isandroidapp="false" data-isiosapp="false" data-ismshop="false" data-marketplaceid="ATVPDKIKX0DER"><div id="R17ZRRSTSEBFKI" data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-R17ZRRSTSEBFKI" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-hook="review" class="a-section aok-relative" data-csa-c-id="ajxwot-ylqpdg-1ckdbt-uiab98"><div data-hook="genome-widget" class="a-row a-spacing-mini"><a href="https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AEI4YXLUI75XSNMS4Q2BW2MRL27Q?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top" data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-R17ZRRSTSEBFKI_profile" data-csa-c-type="element" class="a-profile _Y3Itd_profile-link_2n23E" data-a-size="small" data-csa-c-id="mbknkn-81ioxt-1fvkue-br86f"><div aria-hidden="true" class="a-profile-avatar-wrapper"><div class="a-profile-avatar"><img src="./logitech-g502_files/grey-pixel.gif" class="a-lazy-loaded" data-src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default._SX48_.png"><noscript><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default._SX48_.png"/></noscript></div></div><div class="a-profile-content"><span class="a-profile-name">Sharpie</span></div></a></div><div class="_Y3Itd_single-review-star-rating-bar-desktop_1T97A"><i data-hook="review-star-rating" class="a-icon a-icon-star a-star-4"><span class="a-icon-alt">4 out of 5 stars</span></i><span class="a-letter-space"></span></div><a class="a-size-base a-color-base a-link-normal a-text-bold" href="https://www.amazon.com/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R17ZRRSTSEBFKI/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&amp;ie=UTF8"><h5 class="_Y3Itd_single-review-title_2aKRE" data-hook="reviewTitle" lang="en-US">Great mouse but terrible software</h5></a><div data-hook="review-by-line" class="a-row a-spacing-none"><span data-hook="review-date" class="a-size-base a-color-tertiary">Reviewed in the United States on August 15, 2026</span></div><div data-hook="product-variation-attributes" class="a-row a-spacing-mini"><a data-hook="format-strip" class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.com/portal/customer-reviews/B092CGJ1S5/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_fmt?_encoding=UTF8&amp;formatType=current_format"><span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary">Color: White<i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i></span><span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary">Style: Wireless<i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i></span><span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary">Pattern Name: RGB<i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i></span><span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary">Configuration: Mouse</span></a><i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i><span class="_Y3Itd_inline-contributor_33jDb"><div data-hook="review-badges"><a class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.com/gp/help/customer/display.html/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_avp?ie=UTF8&amp;nodeId=G8UYX7LALQC8V9KA"><span data-hook="avp-badge" class="a-size-mini a-color-state a-text-bold">Verified Purchase</span></a></div></span></div><div data-hook="reviewTextContainer" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-text-container_325WM"><div data-hook="reviewText" class="a-cardui-deck _Y3Itd_card-deck_37S9P" data-a-remove-top-gutter="true" data-a-remove-bottom-gutter="true" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-6"><div class="a-teaser-describedby-collapsed a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-6-teaser-describedby-collapsed">Brief content visible, double tap to read full content.</div><div class="a-teaser-describedby-expanded a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-6-teaser-describedby-expanded">Full content visible, double tap to read brief content.</div><div data-csa-c-slot-id="true" data-csa-c-type="element" class="a-cardui _Y3Itd_peek-expand_3G9Ub" data-a-card-type="basic" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-6-card0" data-csa-c-id="dxk776-nree9t-e0gwiz-sxk7wc"><div class="a-cardui-body _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-reactive-container a-reactive-container-transition" style="height: 120px;"><div><div class="a-cardui-content a-cardui-uninitialized" data-a-max-height="300" style="max-height:300px"><div class="_Y3Itd_relative_1SChh"><div data-hook="reviewRichContentContainer" lang="en-US" class="_Y3Itd_contain-rich-content_2IORW"><p><span>Good mouse, i like it. the buttons are useful, its ergonomic for long sessions, the lighting is cool (even if you can’t see it while using it) and i put some glass skates on and some grip tape to protect the grey rubber grips it already has. the wireless or wired option is great and the battery genuinely lasts a really long time, i charge it like once a week and it charges quick too. only complaint is the software you need to use to set up your dpi settings and lighting and all that is GARBAGE it’s soo bad! they really need to improve the software so for that reason its 4 stars, its that bad.</span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="a-reactive-container-gradient"></div></div></div><div data-hook="reviewExpandButtonContainer" class="a-cardui-footer _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha a-hidden"><div class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer _Y3Itd_read-more-less_2uDYd" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-csa-interaction-