ie</span></div></a></div><div class="a-section a-spacing-none"><div class="_Y3Itd_single-review-star-rating-bar-desktop_1T97A"><i data-hook="review-star-rating" class="a-icon a-icon-star a-star-4"><span class="a-icon-alt">4 out of 5 stars</span></i><span class="a-letter-space"></span></div><a class="a-size-base a-color-base a-link-normal a-text-bold" href="https://www.amazon.com/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R17ZRRSTSEBFKI/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&amp;ie=UTF8"><h5 class="_Y3Itd_single-review-title_2aKRE" data-hook="reviewTitle" lang="en-US">Great mouse but terrible software</h5></a><div data-hook="review-by-line" class="a-row a-spacing-none"><span data-hook="review-date" class="a-size-base a-color-tertiary">Reviewed in the United States on August 15, 2026</span></div><div data-hook="product-variation-attributes" class="a-row a-spacing-mini"><a data-hook="format-strip" class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.com/portal/customer-reviews/B092CGJ1S5/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_fmt?_encoding=UTF8&amp;formatType=current_format"><span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary">Color: White<i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i></span><span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary">Style: Wireless<i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i></span><span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary">Pattern Name: RGB<i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i></span><span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary">Configuration: Mouse</span></a><i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i><span class="_Y3Itd_inline-contributor_33jDb"><div data-hook="review-badges"><a class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.com/gp/help/customer/display.html/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_avp?ie=UTF8&amp;nodeId=G8UYX7LALQC8V9KA"><span data-hook="avp-badge" class="a-size-mini a-color-state a-text-bold">Verified Purchase</span></a></div></span></div></div><p><span>Good mouse, i like it. the buttons are useful, its ergonomic for long sessions, the lighting is cool (even if you can’t see it while using it) and i put some glass skates on and some grip tape to protect the grey rubber grips it already has. the wireless or wired option is great and the battery genuinely lasts a really long time, i charge it like once a week and it charges quick too. only complaint is the software you need to use to set up your dpi settings and lighting and all that is GARBAGE it’s soo bad! they really need to improve the software so for that reason its 4 stars, its that bad.</span></p><ul class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-thumbnail-image-container_2nWBS" data-reviewbind="MediaThumbnailsBlock"><li class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-list-item-style_d1lj6" data-reviewbind="MediaThumbnail"><button data-mediaid="61cmI1c+ozL" data-reviewid="R17ZRRSTSEBFKI" data-thumbidx="0" class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-thumbnail-image-button_2LRc_" data-mix-operations="thumbnailClickHandler" aria-pressed="false"><img alt="" src="./logitech-g502_files/61cmI1c+ozL.jpg" class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-thumbnail-image-view_2J_oP" height="80" width="80"></button></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="a-section a-spacing-top-small _Y3Itd_helpful-votes-container_3iphI"><span data-hook="helpful-vote-statement" class="a-size-base a-color-tertiary">One person found this helpful</span></div><div class="a-section a-spacing-small a-spacing-top-small"><div class="_Y3Itd_single-review-vote-action-bar_10AyR"><div data-hook="helpfulVoteWidget" class="a-section a-spacing-none _Y3Itd_cr-voting-section_1cNTp"><div class="_Y3Itd_cr-helpful-button_1u3UK cr-vote-component" data-hook="helpfulVoteButton" data-mix-operations="HelpfulVoteClickHandler" data-asin="B092CGJ1S5" data-id="R17ZRRSTSEBFKI" data-return-to="DpReview" data-csa-c-type="element" data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-R17ZRRSTSEBFKI_helpful_button" data-csa-c-id="q3qad6-vkdgs1-6f6n65-ifw0u2"><span class="a-button a-button-base" id="a-autoid-50"><span class="a-button-inne