"reviewContainer" data-translatable="false" data-reviewid="R1GLZNQ9LIXH2F" data-asin="B092CGJ1S5" data-mobile="false" data-locale="en-US" data-localelanguagename="English" data-sourcelanguage="en-CA" data-sourcelanguagename="English" data-iscustomerrecognized="true" data-iskindleapp="false" data-isandroidapp="false" data-isiosapp="false" data-ismshop="false" data-marketplaceid="ATVPDKIKX0DER"><div id="R1GLZNQ9LIXH2F" data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review_foreign-R1GLZNQ9LIXH2F" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-hook="review" class="a-section aok-relative" data-csa-c-id="gne0tp-okv0m9-2l80jk-cp2lz4"><div data-hook="genome-widget" class="a-row a-spacing-mini"><div class="a-profile _Y3Itd_profile-link_2n23E" data-a-size="small"><div aria-hidden="true" class="a-profile-avatar-wrapper"><div class="a-profile-avatar"><img src="./logitech-g502_files/grey-pixel.gif" class="a-lazy-loaded" data-src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default._SX48_.png"><noscript><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default._SX48_.png"/></noscript></div></div><div class="a-profile-content"><span class="a-profile-name">QA_0521</span></div></div></div><div class="_Y3Itd_single-review-star-rating-bar-desktop_1T97A"><i data-hook="review-star-rating" class="a-icon a-icon-star a-star-5"><span class="a-icon-alt">5 out of 5 stars</span></i><span class="a-letter-space"></span></div><h5 class="_Y3Itd_single-review-title_2aKRE" data-hook="reviewTitle" lang="en-CA">Excellent wireless mouse for gaming</h5><div data-hook="review-by-line" class="a-row a-spacing-none"><span data-hook="review-date" class="a-size-base a-color-tertiary">Reviewed in Canada on December 11, 2025</span></div><div data-hook="product-variation-attributes" class="a-row a-spacing-mini"><a data-hook="format-strip" class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.com/portal/customer-reviews/B092CGJ1S5/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_fmt?_encoding=UTF8&amp;formatType=current_format"><span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary">Color: White<i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i></span><span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary">Style: Wireless<i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i></span><span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary">Pattern Name: RGB<i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i></span><span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary">Configuration: Mouse</span></a><i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i><span class="_Y3Itd_inline-contributor_33jDb"><div data-hook="review-badges"><a class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.com/gp/help/customer/display.html/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_avp?ie=UTF8&amp;nodeId=G8UYX7LALQC8V9KA"><span data-hook="avp-badge" class="a-size-mini a-color-state a-text-bold">Verified Purchase</span></a></div></span></div><div data-hook="reviewTextContainer" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-text-container_325WM"><div data-hook="reviewText" class="a-cardui-deck _Y3Itd_card-deck_37S9P" data-a-remove-top-gutter="true" data-a-remove-bottom-gutter="true" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-10"><div class="a-teaser-describedby-collapsed a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-10-teaser-describedby-collapsed">Brief content visible, double tap to read full content.</div><div class="a-teaser-describedby-expanded a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-10-teaser-describedby-expanded">Full content visible, double tap to read brief content.</div><div data-csa-c-slot-id="true" data-csa-c-type="element" class="a-cardui _Y3Itd_peek-expand_3G9Ub" data-a-card-type="basic" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-10-card0" data-csa-c-id="6ajgiw-kvcvbh-imyr8-yiretk"><div class="a-cardui-body _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-reactive-container a-reactive-container-transition" style="height: 240px;"><div><div class="a-cardui-content a-cardui-uninitialized" data-a-max-height="300" style="max-height:300px"><div class="_Y3Itd_relative_1SChh"><div data-hook="reviewRichContentContainer" lang="en-CA" class="_Y3Itd_contain-rich-content_2IORW"><p><span>I got this when it was on sale and boy oh boy I LOVE using this mouse for playing games!</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>Very accurate, no lags whatsoever, easy to configure using the desktop app of Logitech. The rgb lights are just perfect adding accent to the mouse’s design - I hate too much lights in the mouse as if it becomes like a christmas light. It has on and off switch but it does go auto sleep if you left it on so another plus to that feature!</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>Charging takes a bit but faster than other wireless mouse. Battery life is great (would last for more than a week playing games a couple hours a day)</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>I have big hands and mouse felt nicely (not too small and not big either)</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>Only comment I will add is that I don’t think it was worth the full price but if you see it go on sale for like 25% or more, heck yeah add to cart and checkout right away!!!</span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="a-reactive-container-gradient"></div></div></div><div data-hook="reviewExpandButtonContainer" class="a-cardui-footer _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha a-hidden"><div class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer _Y3Itd_read-more-less_2uDYd" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-csa-interaction-events="click" data-csa-c-id="cv3the-4fnidm-qn0ie6-bu6zmi"><a href="javascript:void(0)" class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer-button" role="button"><span class="a-expander-icon"><i class="a-css-icon a-css-icon-draw a-css-icon-expand"></i></span><span class="a-see-more a-color-link"><span class="a-see-more-text" style="">Read more</span><span class="a-see-less-text" style="display:none">Read less</span></span></a></div></div></div></div><div data-hook="translationSpinner" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner-container_ypxf2" style="display: none !important;"><div class="a-spinner-wrapper _Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner_1tBUJ"><span class="a-spinner a-spinner-medium"></span></div></div></div><div class="a-section a-spacing-small"><div class="a-section a-spacing-none _Y3Itd_single-review-image-tile-section_15c2C"><button class="_Y3Itd_single-review-thumbnail-container_9KgXc" data-mix-operations="SingleReviewMediaImageThumbnailClickHandler" data-reviewid="R1GLZNQ9LIXH2F" data-physicalid="71xYnYE7-jL"><img alt="Excellent wireless mouse for gaming" src="./logitech-g502_files/71xYnYE7-jL._SY500_.jpg" data-hook="review-image-tile" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-image-tile_3c5HW"></button><button class="_Y3Itd_single-review-thumbnail-container_9KgXc" data-mix-operations="SingleReviewMediaImageThumbnailClickHandler" data-reviewid="R1GLZNQ9LIXH2F" data-physicalid="61IkjXaKwWL"><img alt="Excellent wireless mouse for gaming" src="./logitech-g502_files/61IkjXaKwWL._SY500_.jpg" data-hook="review-image-tile" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-image-tile_3c5HW"></button><button class="_Y3Itd_single-review-thumbnail-container_9KgXc" data-mix-operations="SingleReviewMediaImageThumbnailClickHandler" data-reviewid="R1GLZNQ9LIXH2F" data-physicalid="710O8MxVFBL"><img alt="Excellent wireless mouse for gaming" src="./logitech-g502_files/710O8MxVFBL._SY500_.jpg" data-hook="review-image-tile" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-image-tile_3c5HW"></button><button class="_Y3Itd_single-review-thumbnail-container_9KgXc" data-mix-operations="SingleReviewMediaImageThumbnailClickHandler" data-reviewid="R1GLZNQ9LIXH2F" data-physicalid="71dFr1te6sL"><img alt="Excellent wireless mouse for gaming" src="./logitech-g502_files/71dFr1te6sL._SY500_.jpg" data-hook="review-image-tile" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-image-tile_3c5HW"></button><button class="_Y3Itd_single-review-thumbnail-container_9KgXc" data-mix-operations="SingleReviewMediaImageThumbnailClickHandler" data-reviewid="R1GLZNQ9LIXH2F" data-physicalid="713OGGzgl1L"><img alt="Excellent wireless mouse for gaming" src="./logitech-g502_files/713OGGzgl1L._SY500_.jpg" data-hook="review-image-tile" 